                                "sense_id": "9d814b9d-9bfc-3377-8a23-e6b7252f057b",
                                "text": "This long sequence skilfully deploys the rhetorical tropes of procatalepsis and concessio, pre-emption and concession: that is, they concede the accuracy of certain classic attacks on communism, but in ways that redound on their opponents."
